&control
    calculation   = 'vc-relax',
    prefix        = 'pzt',
    pseudo_dir    = './pseudos',
    outdir        = './tmp_pzt',
    tstress       = .true.,
    tprnfor       = .true.,
    forc_conv_thr = 1.0d-4,
    etot_conv_thr = 1.0d-5
/
&system
    ibrav      = 0,
    nat        = 10,
    ntyp       = 4,
    ecutwfc    = 60,
    ecutrho    = 540,
    occupations= 'fixed',
    input_dft  = 'LDA'
/
&electrons
    conv_thr   = 1.0d-8,
    mixing_beta= 0.3
/
&ions
    ion_dynamics = 'bfgs'
/
&cell
    cell_dynamics = 'bfgs'
/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Pb  207.2   Pb.pz-d-van.UPF
 Zr   91.224 Zr.pz-spn-rrkjus_psl.1.0.0.UPF
 Ti   47.867 Ti.pz-sp-van_ak.UPF
 O    15.9994 O.pz-van_ak.UPF

CELL_PARAMETERS (angstrom)
 3.90  0.00  0.00
 0.00  3.90  0.00
 0.00  0.00  8.28      ! doubled c (≈ 2 × 4.14)

ATOMIC_POSITIONS (crystal)
! --- subcell A (0 ≤ z < 0.5): Ti-layer ---
 Pb  0.0000  0.0000  0.0200
 Ti  0.5000  0.5000  0.5400
 O   0.5000  0.0000  0.6200
 O   0.0000  0.5000  0.6200
 O   0.5000  0.5000  0.1100

! --- subcell B (0.5 ≤ z < 1.0): Zr-layer (shifted by +0.5 along c) ---
 Pb  0.0000  0.0000  0.5200
 Zr  0.5000  0.5000  0.0400
 O   0.5000  0.0000  0.1200
 O   0.0000  0.5000  0.1200
 O   0.5000  0.5000  0.6100

K_POINTS automatic
 6 6 4  0 0 0
